  "methodology_note": "Q1/Q2/Q3 periods added 2026-08-26 from primebank.com.bd's own unaudited interim financial statements. npl_ratio_pct/roa_pct/roe_pct/car_pct/provision_coverage_pct are left null for all Q1/Q2/Q3 periods -- this bank's interim filings disclose only a Balance Sheet + Profit and Loss Account (no Basel III/asset-quality/classified-loan detail), unlike its annual reports, so these ratios are genuinely not available at quarterly granularity, not merely uncalculated. yoy_growth_pct is left null for the same new periods (not computed in this pass). ldr_pct and cost_to_income_pct ARE calculated for Q1/Q2/Q3 (both are directly derivable from the same period's own balance sheet / P&L without needing averaging or annualization, unlike roa_pct/roe_pct)."
